      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im noticing some really weird stuff with my smart home setup lately. my nest thermostat keeps jumping up 3 degrees at like 2am exactly, and my hue lights have been shifting to this weird dim amber color every night around midnight. it feels... intentional? like there's a specific schedule being run that i didn't set up. do u think someone could be remotely accessing my hub or something?",
